{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02891","headline":"奉和太子纳妃太平公主出降三首 一 · 胡元范","name":"奉和太子纳妃太平公主出降三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝子威仪绝，储妃礼度优。\n叠鼓陪仙观，凝笳翼画輈。\n郁郁神香满，奕奕彩云浮。\n排空列锦罽，腾欢溢皇州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"胡元范","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02891.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02891","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}